## Treasury

Current Treasury Size: tidak diungkap secara detail secara real-time; treasury on-chain transparan di alamat Ronin 0xF40... (Community Treasury) dan alamat Sky Mavis operational treasury (tidak dipublikasikan alamat spesifik)
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0xF40...
Sources: https://snapshot.org/#/axieinfinity.eth

Treasury Composition: tidak diungkap rinci; diketahui mengandung AXS (staked/unstaked), RON, SLP, WETH, USDC, dan NFT (Land, Axie, Item) dari protocol fee dan 초기 alokasi
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0xF40...
Sources: https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/

Stablecoin Holdings: tidak diungkap jumlah spesifik; on-chain explorer menunjukkan saldo USDC di alamat Community Treasury
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0xF40...
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge

Native Token Holdings: tidak diungkap jumlah spesifik; AXS dan RON staked di treasury untuk governance dan validator operations
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0xF40...
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/

Other Assets: NFT Land (Lunacia), NFT Axie, NFT Item, RNS domains yang dikumpulkan dari protocol fee marketplace dan breeding
Sources: https://marketplace.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/marketplace/overview
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/

Treasury Custodian: Axie Infinity Community Treasury (DAO) dikendalikan oleh pemegang veAXS/staked AXS melalui governance Snapshot; Sky Mavis operational treasury dikelola internal Sky Mavis Pte. Ltd.
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/
Sources: https://snapshot.org/#/axieinfinity.eth
Sources: https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/

## Revenue Model

Revenue Stream: Mavis Market Protocol Fee
Status: Live
Description: Fee 4.25% dari volume transaksi NFT (Axie, Land, Item, RNS); dibagi 2.125% ke Community Treasury dan 2.125% ke staked AXS reward
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/marketplace/overview
Sources: https://marketplace.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/mavis-market-is-live-

Revenue Stream: Katana DEX Protocol Fee
Status: Live
Description: Fee 0.3% per swap (0.25% ke LP, 0.05% ke Treasury); diterapkan pada semua pasangan AXS/SLP/RON/WETH/USDC
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/dex/katana
Sources: https://katana.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/katana-dex-is-live-on-ronin-

Revenue Stream: Ronin Bridge Withdrawal Fee
Status: Live
Description: Fee withdraw ponte (variabel, biasanya 0.001–0.01 ETH equivalent + gas Ethereum); masuk ke Treasury/operator bridge
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/bridges/ronin-bridge
Sources: https://bridge.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-bridge-reopening

Revenue Stream: Axie Breeding Fee
Status: Live
Description: Setiap breeding memerlukan SLP (burn) + AXS (fee ke Treasury); jumlah AXS fee bervariasi sesuai generation dan supply SLP
Sources: https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/breeding
Sources: https://whitepaper.axieinfinity.com/
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0x...breeding...

Revenue Stream: Land Transaction Fee & Marketplace Royalties
Status: Live
Description: Royalties ERC-2981 dari secondary sales Land NFT (4.25% via Mavis Market); primary sale Land sudah selesai (2021-2022)
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/marketplace/overview
Sources: https://homeland.axieinfinity.com/
Sources: https://marketplace.roninchain.com/collections/land

Revenue Stream: Staking Reward Distribution (Protocol Share)
Status: Live
Description: Bagian dari block reward RON dan gas fee dialokasikan ke Treasury melalui validator commission dan protocol-level reward distribution
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/consensus/overview
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/staking

Revenue Stream: Ronin Name Service (RNS) Registration & Renewal Fee
Status: Live
Description: Fee pendaftaran dan perpanjangan tahunan domain .ron (denominasi RON); masuk ke Treasury
Sources: https://docs.roninchain.com/ronin/rns/overview
Sources: https://rns.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/ronin-name-service-rns-is-live-

Revenue Stream: Game Server / Matchmaking (Indirect)
Status: Live
Description: Tidak ada fee langsung; biaya operasional server ditanggung Sky Mavis; pendapatan tidak langsung via retensi pemain yang drive volume breeding/marketplace
Sources: https://docs.axieinfinity.com/game-mechanics/
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/
Sources: https://skyma.vis/about

Revenue Stream: Grant & Ecosystem Fund (Inflow)
Status: Live
Description: Dana masuk dari investor/ekosistem untuk grant builder (contoh: Ronin Ecosystem Fund dari Series B); bukan revenue operasional tapi funding ekosistem
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/axie-infinity-raises-152-million-series-b-
Sources: https://roninchain.com/ecosystem
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/grants/

