## Financial Risk

Risk: Treasury Concentration Risk
Description: Treasury DAO dan Sky Mavis operational treasury terkonsentrasi pada native token AXS, RON, SLP, dan NFT illiquid; terpengaruh volatilitas harga
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/address/0xF40...
Sources: https://gov.axieinfinity.com/t/treasury/
Sources: https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/axie-infinity

Risk: Revenue Decline (Bear Market Impact)
Description: Volume marketplace, DEX, breeding, dan bridge fee turun signifikan 2022-2023 pasca-peak 2021; memengaruhi pendapatan protocol fee
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/
Sources: https://www.theblock.co/post/135000/sky-mavis-axie-infinity-layoffs
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/

Risk: Funding Dependency on Series B Treasury
Description: Operasional Sky Mavis bergantung pada sisa dana Series B ($152M) setelah layoffs 2022; tidak ada ronde funding baru tercatat 2023-2024
Sources: https://www.theblock.co/post/135000/sky-mavis-axie-infinity-layoffs
Sources: https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/sky-mavis/funding_rounds
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/

Risk: Legal Financial Risk (US SEC Wells Notice)
Description: Wells Notice SEC Maret 2024 terkait penjualan AXS dan operasi exchange (Katana/Ronin Bridge) berpotensi menyita dana, denda, atau larangan operasi di AS
Sources: https://www.sec.gov/litigation/admin/2024/33-11298.pdf
Sources: https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2024/03/06/axie-infinity-developer-sky-mavis-receives-wells-notice-from-sec/
Sources: https://www.theblock.co/post/284000/sec-wells-notice-sky-mavis-axie-infinity

Risk: Legal Financial Risk (Philippines SEC Advisory)
Description: Advisory 2022 menyatakan SLP sebagai securities tidak terdaftar; berpotensi membatasi operasi di pasar pengguna terbesar (Philippines)
Sources: https://www.sec.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/SEC-Advisory-No.-2022-12.pdf
Sources: https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2022/07/11/philippines-sec-warns-against-axie-infinity-slp-token/
Sources: https://business.inquirer.net/357783/sec-warns-public-on-axie-infinity-slp

Risk: Ronin Bridge Exploit Legacy Cost
Description: Kerugian $625M (Maret 2022); restitusi $300M (Sky Mavis $150M + Binance $150M); sisa ~$325M ditanggung Treasury/DAO; risiko klaim hukum tambahan
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/post-mortem-ronin-bridge-exploit
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-bridge-reopening
Sources: https://axieinfinity.medium.com/ronin-bridge-reopening-and-user-reimbursement-

Risk: Validator Centralization Financial Risk
Description: Validator set awal permissioned (PoA) dan DPoS masih didominasi entitas institusional awal; risiko kolusi atau tekanan regulator pada validator besar (Binance, Google Cloud, dll.)
Sources: https://explorer.roninchain.com/validators
Sources: https://blog.roninchain.com/ronin-pos-launch
Sources: https://forum.roninchain.com/t/validator-decentralization/

